abstract: >-
  Strictly deduplicated cross-disciplinary open-problem research infrastructure
  cataloging 1,900 unsolved, open, and hard problems spanning 8 Macro-Pillars,
  28 Superdomains, 8 Physical/Formal Substrates, and 7 Abstraction Layers wired into
  1 biconnected 5,808-edge knowledge graph (0 articulation points, 0 bridges, 0
  dangling links), paired with 103 zero-Mathlib Pure Lean 4.35.0 formal invariant
  and adversarial-refutation theorems verified across 6 independent proof kernels,
  a 10-page AMS-LaTeX white paper, offline SQLite FTS5 Hybrid RAG (100.0% MRR@5),
  an 11-tool stdio MCP server, an automated external registry delta auditor,
  3 reproducible Track B frontier probes, a rubric sensitivity diff engine,
  and an immutable Karpathy-style AutoResearch harness
  (AQS = 97.99). Zero (0/1,900) overarching open problems are claimed solved; Lean
  verifies internal invariants only.
